"meintegration.appmanager.title" : "Applications Manager",
"sdp.overview.integrations.desktopCentral.content" : "<p>ManageEngine Endpoint Central (d\u0159\u00edve Desktop Central) je n\u00e1stroj pro spr\u00e1vu po\u010d\u00edta\u010d\u016f, kter\u00fd pom\u00e1h\u00e1 automatizovat pravideln\u00e9 \u010dinnosti v\u00a0po\u010d\u00edta\u010di, jako je instalace softwarov\u00fdch oprav a\u00a0servisn\u00edch bal\u00ed\u010dk\u016f na pracovn\u00edch stanic\u00edch a\u00a0serverech Windows. D\u00edky integraci aplikace ServiceDesk Plus budete moci konfigurovat a\u00a0spravovat prost\u0159ed\u00ed Windows z\u00a0jednoho m\u00edsta. Tato integrace umo\u017e\u0148uje optimalizaci \u010dinnost\u00ed spr\u00e1vy po\u010d\u00edta\u010de a\u00a0mobiln\u00edch za\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed (MDM) jako nasazen\u00ed softwaru, spr\u00e1vu oprav, spr\u00e1vu profil\u016f, d\u00e1lkov\u00e9 ovl\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed a\u00a0spou\u0161t\u011bn\u00ed vlastn\u00edch skript\u016f z\u00a0konzoly helpdesku IT.</p>",
