"sdp.overview.serviceCatalog.serviceLvlAgmt.content" : "<p>Smlouvy o\u00a0\u00farovni slu\u017eeb (SLA) mohou b\u00fdt definov\u00e1ny pro slu\u017eby poskytovan\u00e9 servisn\u00edm t\u00fdmem IT koncov\u00fdm u\u017eivatel\u016fm. SLA mohou b\u00fdt konfigurov\u00e1ny a\u00a0p\u0159i\u0159azeny jednotliv\u00fdm \u0161ablon\u00e1m slu\u017eeb dop\u0159edu. Tyto SLA zaji\u0161\u0165uj\u00ed, \u017ee po\u017eadovan\u00e1 slu\u017eba bude poskytnuta v\u00a0dohodnut\u00e9 dob\u011b. Pro r\u016fzn\u00e9 slu\u017eby lze konfigurovat r\u016fzn\u00e9 SLA a\u00a0pro p\u0159\u00edpad, \u017ee slu\u017eba nen\u00ed poskytnuta ve stanoven\u00e9 dob\u011b, lze konfigurovat eskalace.</p>",
