"sdp.selfservice.task.closedvscompleted.help.content" : "Stav dokon\u010den\u00ed \u00falohy je ur\u010den n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edmi pracovn\u00edmi postupy<br/><br/>1. Z\u00e1vislosti mezi \u00falohami.<br/>2. Po\u010det dokon\u010den\u00fdch \u00faloh v\u00a0pohledech Po\u017eadavek, Projekt, Zm\u011bna a\u00a0na kart\u00e1ch Projekt/Miln\u00edk.<br/>3. Po\u017eadavek, Probl\u00e9m a Pravidla uzav\u0159en\u00ed zm\u011bny.<br/>4. Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed vych\u00e1zej\u00edc\u00ed z dokon\u010den\u00ed \u00falohy.",
